SUMMARY:TD Music Tuesdays: Union Summer
DESCRIPTION:In partnership with our premier sponsor TD\, Union Summer presents a diverse and dynamic lineup of artists in collaboration with TD-supported festivals. July and August programming features performers from TD-supported festivals\, showcasing a wide range of global sounds and emerging talent. \nThis TD Music Tuesdays edition is presented in partnership with Afrofest\, celebrating African and diaspora music\, culture\, and community through live performance at Union Summer. \nStay tuned for artist announcement for this slot.
