SUMMARY:Tuesday Tastemaker Series: Union Summer
DESCRIPTION:Tuesday Tastemaker Series at Union Summer brings together music lovers\, industry insiders\, and emerging talent for an elevated midweek experience. In partnership with Polaris Music Prize\, Departure Festival\, and Mirvish Productions\, the patio transforms into a vibrant showcase designed for discovery and connection where tastemakers gather to mix\, mingle\, and experience incredible live music. \nThis edition is presented in partnership with Polaris Music Prize\, featuring a curated live performance as part of the summer programming series. \nStay tuned for artist announcement for this slot.
