SUMMARY:Spotlight on Women: Heather Russell
DESCRIPTION:Explore a lineup of women in music with a roster of Toronto’s top female talent. \nSpotlight on Women celebrates the creativity\, artistry\, and impact of women in music\, showcasing a diverse range of voices shaping Toronto’s live music scene. Each performance highlights both emerging and established artists across genres. \nHeather Russell joins the series for a midday performance at Union Summer. Stay tuned for additional artist details. \nThis program is in partnership with City Hall Live\, a City of Toronto program that creates paid opportunities for local bands and provides accessible live music experiences for residents and visitors.
