SUMMARY:Best of Union Beats: K Stylez
DESCRIPTION:We’re bringing our favourite DJs from our indoor Union Beats program to the patio! Turn up your midday with the best beats in the city. \nUnion Summer’s mid-day DJ sessions bring laid-back vibes and feel-good energy to the patio—perfect for a break in the sun. Whether you’re grabbing a bite\, meeting friends\, or just soaking it all in\, our DJs are spinning the ultimate soundtrack to your day. \nK Stylez is a Toronto-based DJ whose early passion for music and instrumentation led him to pursue DJing professionally. Since 2015\, he has built an international performance career\, playing across Canada and abroad at clubs\, festivals\, and major cultural events. \nHis experience includes performances at OVO Bounce 2019\, A3C Festival in Atlanta\, and numerous Afro-pop concerts and events. Known for his versatile sound and high-energy sets\, K Stylez continues to represent Toronto’s global music influence on diverse stages.
URL:https://torontounion.ca/event/best-of-union-beats-k-stylez/
LOCATION:Union\, 65 Front Street West\, Toronto\, ON\, Canada
CATEGORIES:Union Summer
