SUMMARY:TGIT: Quincy Bullen
DESCRIPTION:Thursdays just became the new Fridays. Head to Union Summer for a high-energy night featuring live bands. \nUnion Summer’s TGIT series transforms the patio into a vibrant evening destination\, kicking off the weekend early with high-energy performances\, great music\, and a lively crowd. Come for the vibes\, stay for everything that makes Thursday the best night of the week. \nQuincy Bullen is a multi-talented pianist\, producer\, DJ\, and performer known for blending jazz\, R&B\, and soul with contemporary electronic influences. Classically trained with a strong jazz foundation\, he brings a dynamic and genre-fluid approach to performance. \nHis sets fuse funk\, hip hop\, house\, and electronic elements\, creating an energetic and immersive live experience shaped by both musicianship and modern club culture.
URL:https://torontounion.ca/event/tgit-quincy-bullen/
