SUMMARY:Soul Sessions: The Remix Project Artist Showcase
DESCRIPTION:Ease into the weekend with Soul Sessions every Friday night at Union Summer. \nFrom smooth R&B and classic Motown to timeless hits across the decades\, our live performers reimagine the songs you love with fresh energy and irresistible groove. It’s a feel-good night of music\, movement\, and nostalgia—guaranteed to get you dancing under the open sky. \nThe Remix Project Artist Showcase features emerging talent from The Remix Project\, a Toronto-based arts incubator supporting young creatives across music and performance disciplines. The showcase highlights a range of developing artists presenting live sets shaped by mentorship\, collaboration\, and artistic growth. \nThis program is in partnership with The Remix Project.
URL:https://torontounion.ca/event/soul-sessions-the-remix-project-artist-showcase/
