UID:21432-1786188600-1786199400@torontounion.ca
SUMMARY:Sunflower Garden Fest presents : Luciana and friends
DESCRIPTION:Power up your weekend with Saturday Vibes at Union Summer. \nJoin Sunflower Garden Festival for a series of vibrant daytime musical experiences designed to uplift\, inspire\, and bring people together. Each performance blends live musicians\, vocalists\, and DJ sets curated for unique and memorable combinations\, taking audiences on a journey through soulful grooves\, feel-good rhythms\, live improvisation\, and uplifting dance music. \nSunflower Garden Festival is a music and wellness festival that encourages connection\, self-expression\, and celebration through music\, movement\, and community. \nRooted in the values of Sunflower Garden Festival\, these performances invite you to move freely and experience the power of music as a catalyst for community\, self-expression\, and collective wellbeing. \nA rhythmic fusion set blending live percussion\, live guitar and vocals with Latin\, Cuban\, and Afro House musical energy to make you dance! Live vocals by Luciana\, guitar by Gianluca Mauro and percussion with Chris Boulianne.
URL:https://torontounion.ca/event/saturday-vibes-union-summer-4/
LOCATION:Union\, 65 Front Street West\, Toronto\, ON\, Canada
CATEGORIES:Union Summer
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://torontounion.ca/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/32e3153e-9e01-4bde-a694-db0ce0c5ed60-scaled.jpg
GEO:43.6453166;-79.3804073
