SUMMARY:Day Parties: Bambii + Opener
DESCRIPTION:Make Union Summer your first Saturday night stop. Our Day Parties kick things off with a dynamic rotation of live music\, themed weekly to set just the right vibe. From DJ-led dance parties to feel-good live sets\, it’s all about great music\, refreshing drinks\, and a lively crowd ready to move. Start your night where the energy’s already high. \nBambii brings a forward-thinking\, genre-blending DJ set that moves across dancehall\, electronic\, club\, and global bass sounds\, delivering a high-energy experience built for the open-air stage at Union Summer. \nThis program is in partnership with TD Music.
URL:https://torontounion.ca/event/day-parties-bambii-opener/
LOCATION:Union\, 65 Front Street West\, Toronto\, ON\, Canada
CATEGORIES:Union Summer
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://torontounion.ca/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/union.jpg
