SUMMARY:Brunch & Brass: SHOUT!
DESCRIPTION:Soak up the sunshine as lively brass ensembles fill the patio with rich\, feel-good sounds—perfectly paired with a relaxed midday bite. It’s a laid-back\, joyful way to gather\, unwind\, and let the music carry you through your Sunday. \nSHOUT! returns to Union Summer as a dynamic Toronto brass ensemble known for its high-energy performances and rapid growth from small student-led “guerilla concerts” into a full 12-piece band. \nRooted in New Orleans brass traditions\, SHOUT! blends jazz and Western popular music with global rhythmic and harmonic influences\, drawing inspiration from musical cultures across Asia\, Africa\, Eastern Europe\, and South America. The result is a vibrant\, genre-crossing sound built for both movement and celebration.
URL:https://torontounion.ca/event/brunch-brass-shout/
LOCATION:Union\, 65 Front Street West\, Toronto\, ON\, Canada
CATEGORIES:Union Summer
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://torontounion.ca/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/5183edf7-4f84-4353-83e3-974541142bc8.png
GEO:43.6453166;-79.3804073
