SUMMARY:Union Samples: Fenigo
DESCRIPTION:Visit Fenigo brand at the York Kiosk for samples of  Stainless Steel Straw Set including cleaning brush. \n  \nEveryday swaps. Less waste. Fenigo is bringing practical\, reusable solutions to Union Station. Stop by to receive a complimentary Life Without Waste Stainless Steel Straw Set and discover how simple reusable products can help reduce single-use waste every day. \n  \nSampling events are independently operated by third-party brands and agencies. The products being distributed\, sample sizes\, quantities\, giveaway limits\, eligibility requirements\, and event operations are determined solely by the participating brand and may change at the brand’s discretion without notice. \n  \nUnion Station does not control\, manage\, or guarantee the type\, size\, quantity\, quality\, or availability of samples provided. Union Station is not responsible for any changes to the products being distributed or the manner in which they are distributed. Any questions\, concerns\, or feedback regarding a sampling event should be directed to the participating brand. \n  \nSampling hours may vary and events may begin later than scheduled\, pause for breaks\, or conclude early once supplies have been exhausted. Guests are not permitted to queue or wait near the kiosk during non-operating periods. \n  \nWe ask all guests to treat staff\, brand representatives\, and fellow visitors with courtesy and respect. Disruptive\, aggressive\, or inappropriate behaviour may result in refusal of service and denial of participation in the sampling event.”
